<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-PHILIPS RAISED AT GOLDMAN.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-PHILIPS RAISED AT GOLDMAN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philips Electronics NV was raised to &quot;trading buy&quot; from &quot;market outperformer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
